fdroid/

# Rust JNI libraries are generated by cargo-ndk locally and in Android CI.
/Monica for Android/app/src/main/jniLibs/*/libmonica_rust_jni.so

# Design sketches and device captures stay local: they can show vault content
# and they dominate the repository size. Verification notes (.md/.json/.txt)
# are still committed.
/Monica for Android/docs/design/
